DEVICE ARCADE

WHEN started:
  arcade tilemap level cols 10 rows 8 tile 16
  arcade set tile level col 0 row 0 to 2
  arcade set tile level col 1 row 0 to 2
  arcade set tile level col 2 row 0 to 2
  arcade set tile level col 3 row 0 to 2
  arcade set tile level col 4 row 0 to 2
  arcade set tile level col 5 row 0 to 2
  arcade set tile level col 6 row 0 to 2
  arcade set tile level col 7 row 0 to 2
  arcade set tile level col 8 row 0 to 2
  arcade set tile level col 9 row 0 to 2
  arcade set tile level col 0 row 7 to 2
  arcade set tile level col 1 row 7 to 2
  arcade set tile level col 2 row 7 to 2
  arcade set tile level col 3 row 7 to 2
  arcade set tile level col 4 row 7 to 2
  arcade set tile level col 5 row 7 to 2
  arcade set tile level col 6 row 7 to 2
  arcade set tile level col 7 row 7 to 2
  arcade set tile level col 8 row 7 to 2
  arcade set tile level col 9 row 7 to 2
  arcade set tile level col 0 row 1 to 2
  arcade set tile level col 0 row 2 to 2
  arcade set tile level col 0 row 3 to 2
  arcade set tile level col 0 row 4 to 2
  arcade set tile level col 0 row 5 to 2
  arcade set tile level col 0 row 6 to 2
  arcade set tile level col 9 row 1 to 2
  arcade set tile level col 9 row 2 to 2
  arcade set tile level col 9 row 3 to 2
  arcade set tile level col 9 row 4 to 2
  arcade set tile level col 9 row 5 to 2
  arcade set tile level col 9 row 6 to 2
  arcade set wall level tile 2
  arcade create hero kind Player
  arcade place hero x 80 y 64
  arcade set hero stay in screen
  set score to 0
  set frame to 0

WHEN started:
  FOREVER:
    arcade move hero vx (controller dx) vy (controller dy)
    change frame by 1
    IF frame > 3 THEN:
      set frame to 0
    arcade set frame hero to frame
    change score by 1
    arcade score add 1
    wait 100 ms

WHEN started:
  FOREVER:
    arcade create gem kind Gem
    arcade place gem x randint(32, 128) y randint(32, 96)
    wait 2 seconds

WHEN started:
  ARCADE ON OVERLAP Player Gem:
    arcade score add 10
